    "notes": [
      "One additional allocation/free per cached Font instance. At full cache capacity, entry plus Font requests 240 bytes versus the old 232; unused capacity is smaller. These are requested C structure bytes, excluding allocator headers/slack/RSS.",
      "A GPU-materialized raster uses 48-byte image storage plus a 48-byte Texture record instead of the old 88-byte embedded layout; CPU-only raster storage shrinks by 40 bytes. The additional Texture allocation exists only after GPU materialization.",
